  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0 — tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.4.0 in lockstep; no API changes. Binary-compatibility validation against the published 1.3.0 baseline is now enabled for this package. The release adds cloud envelope-key providers to the family (PostQuantum.FileEncryption.Aws and PostQuantum.FileEncryption.AzureKeyVault); register the provider instance yourself and pass it per call — key material and cloud clients stay in your composition root. No format change: the .pqfe v2 container format remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
